# The top repo `spell` tracks only the glue (its package.json, yarn.lock, .yarnrc.yml, repos.json5, tools/, the
# cross-repo rules):  every child repo is its own git repo, cloned inside it by `yarn clone`, and ignored here.
/spell-*/
# the two data folders (epic repo-split J5):  the content repo (its own git repo, local only) and your projects (a plain
# folder);  links until the move puts the real folders here
/spell.epics
/spell.spaces
# WWOD and the three logs:  a link to spell-util's main checkout (`spell-util/agents/`), as in every child repo
/agents

node_modules
.yarn/install-state.gz
.DS_Store
*.log
*.code-workspace
# the MAIN checkout's marker:  worktree windows hide its folder's files (spell-epic's window script)
/.spell-main
